      "message": "After running the amrnb_enc_fuzzer for over 3 days, we encountered an issue with the file timeout-0c54690cbc0dfd0b7168f490741a62872df46c22. The cause of the issue is that 0x80000000 (2147483648) exceeds the positive range of a WORD32. To resolve the problem, we should return 0x7FFFFFFF (2147483647) instead.",
